Package: dozeguard
Architecture: all
Depends: ${python3:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, python3-psutil, python3-dbus-next
Description: Per-user Linux sleep inhibitor
 DozeGuard temporarily inhibits system sleep while a user session is active.
 Sleep inhibition currently requires systemd-logind.

Package: dozeguard-tray
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dozeguard (= ${binary:Version})
Recommends: python3-pyside6.qtwidgets
Description: Optional desktop tray and window for DozeGuard
 DozeGuard tray controls sessions and displays their current status.
 This package also enables background login startup by default. Install
 PySide6 from the distribution or with the project's optional tray extra.
